Name:
  codestream

Functionality:
  Encoding or Decoding text.
  
Building:
  make                 => non dynamic library version
  make codestream_libv => dynamic library version

Usage:
  See output of '@program -h".

Currently Supported Encoding:
  XOR
  Base64
  Custom that map 1 byte to 2 byte [deprecated]

Environment:
  Language - C++
  Standard - gnu++2a
  Kernel   - Linux 5.4.32
  Compiler - gcc 15.2
  GLibc    - 2.31

Author:
  Zephyr

Addition Message:
  This is a shit.
